GITCAPI  CSECT
GITCAPI  AMODE 24
GITCAPI  RMODE 24
         ENTRY GITCAPI
         EXTRN GITNAPI
* GCCCMS R1 -> argument list; first word -> six-word API block.
* Tail branch preserves the original C caller's R14 and R13.
         L     1,0(1)
         L     15,=V(GITNAPI)
         BR    15
         LTORG
         END
